  "prefLabel": "He-E 701.01 Purpose",
  "priorExpiration": "2007-04-07",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-E 701.01 Purpose. The purpose of the adult protective services program is to:\n\n(a) Receive and investigate reports of abuse, neglect, self-neglect, or exploitation of vulnerable adults;\n\n(b) Provide protective services, if necessary; and\n\n(c) Maintain the department of health and human services, bureau of adult and aging services (BAAS) state registry in accordance with RSA 161-F:49.\n\nSource. #5008, eff 11-27-90, EXPIRED: 11-27-96\n\nNew. #6867, eff 10-9-98; ss by #8727, INTERIM, eff 10-9-06, EXPIRED: 4-7-07\n\nNew. #8868, eff 4-19-07; (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for He-E 700) #10179, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13600, eff 3-24-23",
